    <ol>
      <li><strong>The field box</strong> — exactly
          <code>fl-field__input</code>: 44px, 1px border, 4px radius, the
          same hover/focus/error/disabled states as text fields.</li>
      <li><strong>Chevron</strong> — drawn via a background-image at the
          right edge, replacing the platform arrow that
          <code>appearance:none</code> removes.</li>
      <li><strong>Helper text</strong> — same
          <code>fl-field__help</code> slot; error and filled variants
          compose like any field.</li>
    </ol>
